<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PAG details capitalisation award terms.</title>
<headline>PAG details capitalisation award terms.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PAG Ltd said on Friday shareholders will be entitled to two new shares for every 100 shares held in terms of its capitalisation award.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
